        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Like its predecessor, Stakes Winner 2 is a 2D horse racing game. Choosing from one of the game's selection of horses, players must compete in a series of races on different tracks to earn money and prestige. Each horse that players can select is rated according to speed, stamina, and burst.\n\nPlayers control their horses with the joystick and three buttons. Pressing the A button repeatedly keeps the horse accelerated with a slight drain of the stamina bar, while pressing the B button applies the rider crop to the horse. This results in a slight burst of speed at the cost of draining the horse's stamina bar faster.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Como su predecesor, Stakes Winner 2 es un juego de carreras de caballos en 2D. Eligiendo uno de los caballos disponibles, los jugadores deben competir en una serie de carreras en distintos circuitos para ganar dinero y prestigio. Cada caballo seleccionable tiene valores de velocidad, resistencia y arranque.\n\nLos jugadores controlan a sus caballos con el joystick y tres botones. Pulsar repetidamente el botón A mantiene al caballo acelerado, con un ligero consumo de la barra de resistencia, mientras que pulsar el botón B aplica la fusta al caballo. Esto produce un breve impulso de velocidad, a costa de agotar la barra de resistencia del caballo más rápido.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "1996",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
      ],
